{"id":"95ac53e11cf61387","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive Shoensfield Absoluteness Instance","display":"df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance — ZFC Descriptive Shoensfield Absoluteness Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance — ZFC Descriptive Shoensfield Absoluteness Instance","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion3-analytical-hierarchy-level.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive-shoensfield-absoluteness-instance — ZFC Descriptive Shoensfield Absoluteness Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55c96a19a00b58ed\" href=\"?note=55c96a19a00b58ed\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion3-analytical-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion3-analytical-hierarchy-level.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\varphi,x\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\varphi,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_2,\\Pi^1_2\\subseteq V\">\\(\\Sigma^1_2,\\Pi^1_2\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55c96a19a00b58ed\" href=\"?note=55c96a19a00b58ed\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion3-analytical-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion3-analytical-hierarchy-level.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_2\">\\(\\models_2\\)</span> is the metalinguistic standard second-order-arithmetic satisfaction relation for the fixed coding used by the analytical-hierarchy atom.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveShoensfieldAbsolutenessInstance}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveShoensfieldAbsolutenessInstance}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}shoensfield\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}instance} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveShoensfieldAbsolutenessInstance}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,N,\\varphi,x) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\n\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\n=\\{\\alpha\\in N:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\n\\land x\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^1_2\\cup\\Pi^1_2\n\\land\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap M\\rangle\\models_2\\varphi(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap N\\rangle\\models_2\\varphi(x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}shoensfield\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}instance} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveShoensfieldAbsolutenessInstance}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,N,\\varphi,x) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\n\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\n=\\{\\alpha\\in N:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\n\\land x\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^1_2\\cup\\Pi^1_2\n\\land\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap M\\rangle\\models_2\\varphi(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap N\\rangle\\models_2\\varphi(x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq N\">\\(M\\subseteq N\\)</span> 不足以保证 Shoenfield 绝对性；这里显式要求传递 ZFC 模型、相同序数、实参数与二阶算术第二层复杂度。</li>\n<li>The first-order set-structure satisfaction predicate does not interpret the fixed second-order formula coding, so the statement is explicitly placed at the standard-semantics metalevel.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-1","targ